%N A111750 Primes p such that (p+j)^3 - (p+j)^2 +1 are primes for j=0 to 3.
%H A111750 Jeff Sponaugle, <a href="/A111750/b111750.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%o A111750 (Python)
%o A111750 from gmpy2 import is_prime
%o A111750 def ok(k): return is_prime(k) and all(is_prime((k+j)**3-(k+j)**2+1) for j in range(4))
%o A111750 print([k for k in range(4*10**7) if ok(k)]) # _Michael S. Branicky_, Oct 16 2026
%Y A111750 Primes in A111502.
